,X_\\bullet\\in V,\\quad\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb I,I,\\leq_I,\\Omega,Y,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,X_\\bullet\\in V,\\quad\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I,\\Omega,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\;\\left(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I,\\Omega,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\;\\left(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordered index structure is an explicit argument. Adaptedness means that each coordinate is measurable with respect to the sigma-algebra available at its time index on the designated sample space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md","status":"resolved","id":"20d69bde348c5967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb I,I,\\leq_I,\\Omega,Y,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,X_\\bullet\\in V,\\quad\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I,\\Omega,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\;\\left(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"f22789c9866bef27","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9b2dc9132f1cd4f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S$, $\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S$, $\\mathrm{Poset}$, and $\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ are as in [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-prob2-adapted-process.md]], [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md]], [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], and [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-prob2-adapted-process.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-adapted-process]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","20d69bde348c5967","8902399f82dbe8a2","36d7463d215be751"]}